<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 56, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#BFD5EF', letterSpacing: 2 }}>03 实验与结论</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#BFD5EF' }}>F1 · 项目介绍</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 18, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>最重要的结论，是一个否定性结论</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>它推翻了我们自己诊断模块的一个核心设计</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 14, height: 522, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>

        {/* 核心金句条 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 86, background: '#0E3F8C', borderLeft: '6px solid #FFC107', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.4, flex: 1 }}>
                在「全局等频箱 × 分位协变量层」框架下，
                <span style={{ color: '#FFC107', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>连续干预的机制性正性违背，在原理上无法被诊断</span>。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        {/* 三重证据 */}
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, height: 216 }}>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>放大样本量</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    样本 3,000 → 48,000，空箱层 <b>4</b> → <b>0</b>。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        ⇒ 机制缺失不会随扩样本消失
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#1E4FA8', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>置换零模型</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    重排干预使 T ⟂ X，正性必然成立：空箱层
                    <b>4,3,5,2,1</b> → <b>0,0,0,0,0</b>。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        ⇒ 原阳性结果全是伪影
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FBE9E8', border: '2px solid #D9534F', padding: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#D9534F', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>决定性实验</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    人为<b>硬截断</b>支撑集，低箱概率<b>恰为 0</b>：
                    7,2,1,1,0,0 —— 同样收敛到 0。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                        ⇒ 连概率为 0 都测不出，是分辨率问题
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        {/* 根因 + 修法 */}
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, height: 178 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 340, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568' }}>框架分辨率上限</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>n/405</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>
                    每格期望样本被层数与箱数限死 ⇒ 空箱计数必然依赖样本量
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>修法：改成诚实的四分类</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, flexWrap: 'wrap' }}>
                    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, height: 30, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 15, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>ok</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, height: 30, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 15, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>sparse</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, height: 30, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 15, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>narrow</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, height: 30, background: '#FFC107', borderRadius: 15, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>undetermined</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    关键纪律：<b>undetermined 不等于「结构性」</b>，
                    它只说「此样本量下<b>判不了</b>」。
                </Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>本条结论已写入项目全部 6 份核心文档；完整定位过程见 05-验证/修正记录.md 的 R-11</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>10 / 12</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
